 of an appropriate","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"objects to handle the display.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNAnnotation"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPointAnnotation":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNPointAnnotation"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"MLNPointAnnotation","abstract":[{"text":"An ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" object represents a one-dimensional shape located at a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"single geographical coordinate. Depending on how it is used, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointAnnotation","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" object is known as a point annotation or point shape. For","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"example, you could use a point shape to represent a city at low zoom levels, an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"address at high zoom levels, or the location of a long press gesture.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpointannotation"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNShape":{"abstract":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","type":"reference"},{"text":" is an abstract class that represents a shape or annotation. Shapes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"constitute the content of a map — not only the overlays atop the map, but also"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the content that forms the base map.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnshape","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNShape","title":"MLNShape","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNShape"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNVectorTileSource":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNVectorTileSource"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"MLNVectorTileSource","abstract":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is a map content source that supplies tiled vector data","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in ","type":"text"},{"text":"Mapbox Vector Tile","type":"text"},{"text":" format","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to be shown on the map. The location of and metadata about the tiles are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"defined either by an option dictionary or by an external file that conforms to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TileJSON specification","type":"text"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A vector tile source is added to an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" object along with one or more","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorStyleLayer","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" objects. A vector style layer defines the appearance of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"any content supplied by the vector tile source.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnvectortilesource"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPointFeatureCluster":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNPointFeatureCluster"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpointfeaturecluster","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointFeatureCluster","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" object associates a point shape (with an optional"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identifier and attributes) and represents a point cluster."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPointFeatureCluster","type":"topic","role":"symbol","title":"MLNPointFeatureCluster"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotationImage":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNAnnotationImage"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationImage","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"MLNAnnotationImage","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotationImage","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" class is responsible for presenting point-based"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"annotations visually on a map view. Annotation image objects wrap "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIImage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"objects and may be recycled later and put into a reuse queue that is maintained"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the map view."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotationimage"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNFeature":{"fragme